        "Description": "Good Evening 47.\rYour task today is to eliminate a trilogy of mercenaries present in their base of operations in Hokkaido.\r\rShoudai Kurosawa &quot;The Blood Butcher&quot; is a less-than ordinary morgue worker, his experiments are best left up to the imagination.\r\rNails - A serial killer undercover as a Helicopter Pilot, He earned his name from bludgeoning his victims with a nailed bat\r\rEric - He beat your highscore, scandalous!\r\rGood Luck 47!",
